WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.302
This example uses lag to compare an admission with the previous discharge for the same subject.

00:00:06.302 --> 00:00:10.817
The logic is the same kind of sequence analysis we used earlier.

00:00:10.817 --> 00:00:16.912
In Spark, this window query may require sorting within each subject partition.

00:00:16.912 --> 00:00:19.599
Run the query and inspect the gap column.
